@EmployeeRegistry.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:3000

### Sign in as admin
POST {{EmployeeRegistry.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### List employees
GET {{EmployeeRegistry.Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
